{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52885","headline":"吐蕃党舍人临刑 · 浑惟明","name":"吐蕃党舍人临刑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生死谁能免，嗟君最可怜。\n幼男犹在抱，老母未终年。\n爲复冥徒任，爲当命合然。\n设将泉下事，时向梦中传。\n（均见伯三六一九卷，原署「浑维明」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"浑惟明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52885.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52885","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}